        "label": "Launch — H-IIA",
        "description": "Tanegashima, Japan, 2023-09-06. SLIM (Smart Lander for Investigating Moon) — JAXA's first lunar landing attempt. Designed to demonstrate \"pinpoint\" landing — better than 100-m accuracy versus the kilometres of dispersion in earlier Moon landings."
